title: "Quadward: stage-aware, explainable guardrails for tool-using LLM agents"
abstract: "An open-source guardrail library (JavaScript and Python, identical verdicts) that checks user input, untrusted content, model output and tool calls with explainable rules, and a stage-labelled benchmark of 257 cases."
